      </div>
      <div class="problem-card">
        <div class="icon">&#x1F513;</div>
        <h4>Data Breach Risk</h4>
        <p>Every external API call is a potential breach vector. Healthcare organisations cannot afford to trust third-party data processors with PHI.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="problem-card">
        <div class="icon">&#x1F310;</div>
        <h4>Internet Dependency</h4>
        <p>Air-gapped hospital networks, secure clinical environments, and offline deployments are incompatible with cloud-only solutions.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-3">
      <div class="solution-card">
        <div class="icon">&#x1F3E5;</div>
        <h4>Fully On-Premises</h4>
