      </div>
      <div class="solution-card">
        <div class="icon">&#x26A1;</div>
        <h4>Real-Time Processing</h4>
        <p>Integrated OCR engine (Windows.Media.Ocr + Tesseract) processes scanned documents and images in milliseconds &mdash; no external service round-trips.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="solution-card">
        <div class="icon">&#x1F6E1;&#xFE0F;</div>
        <h4>Compliance-First Design</h4>
        <p>Built from the ground up for HIPAA, GDPR, and Israeli privacy law (PPPA). Every architectural decision prioritises data isolation.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

