      <p class="section-sub">Three processing paths for every scenario — REST API, Image Redaction, and Batch Loader.</p>
    </div>

    <h3 style="font-size:18px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px;color:var(--cyan)">📄 Text &amp; Document API Flow</h3>
    <p style="color:var(--text2);font-size:14px;margin-bottom:0">Real-time document redaction via HTTP POST</p>
    <div class="flow">
      <div class="flow-step">
        <div class="flow-circle">&#x1F4E4;</div>
        <h4>Upload</h4><p>POST file via REST API with API key</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flow-arrow">&rarr;</div>
      <div class="flow-step">
        <div class="flow-circle">&#x1F50D;</div>
        <h4>Extract</h4><p>OCR or text extraction by MIME type</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flow-arrow">&rarr;</div>
      <div class="flow-step">
        <div class="flow-circle">&#x1F3AF;</div>
